<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>BeTranslator | Testimonials</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
    
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <section class="testimonials" id="testimonials">
        
        <h1 class="heading" style="text-align: center;">
            Customer <span>Testimonials</span>
        </h1>

        <div class="box-container">

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">AR</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Incredibly fast and the translation was perfect. I was surprised by the speed."</p>
                <h3>Ali Ramzan</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">AS</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Very professional and reliable service. The certified translation was accepted immediately."</p>
                <h3>Abdullah Saim</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">KU</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span style="color:#ccc">★</span><span style="color:#ccc">★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Good quality translation for our website. There were a few minor revisions needed but done fast."</p>
                <h3>Kamran Umar</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">SK</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Excellent service — fast turnaround and flawless translation. Highly recommended."</p>
                <h3>Sara Khan</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">MI</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span style="color:#ccc">★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Professional translators and accurate delivery. Will order again for my next project."</p>
                <h3>Mohammad Iqbal</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">HF</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Outstanding results — recommended for business and legal documents."</p>
                <h3>Haseeb Farooq</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">ZA</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Great communication and attention to detail — my legal documents were translated perfectly."</p>
                <h3>Zain Ahmed</h3>
            </div>

            <div class="box">
                <div class="image">RN</div>
                <div class="stars">
                    <span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span>★</span><span style="color:#ccc">★</span>
                </div>
                <p>"Fast, affordable and very professional — the translator understood our niche terminology."</p>
                <h3>Rida Noor</h3>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>